<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"So, what do you want to do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Really... all right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But, as quick as you can, please. The cherry blossoms are out, too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s condition comes first!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> gave a delighted cry and got abruptly to her feet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Well, since my own condition is good today, I ought to go along with her that far at least.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We cleared the table quickly and left the room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Riiight! Let's go and get to the truth of the matter of this murder case, shall we!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション入り口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駐輪場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Outside it was thoroughly overcast.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was not a single break in the cloud, not a scrap of blue sky to be seen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But there was no wind, and no sign that it would rain either.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Well then, let's go!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Today </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> is oddly fired up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I know she is active by nature, but with me she is very indulgent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Usually, if I show even a little resistance, she backs down at once, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And in spite of that she wants to go, so, really, there is nothing for it...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, my condition today is not that bad, and I had second thoughts about shutting myself up at home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There is a stay-at-home order out, but, well, never mind, never mind!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We each got onto our bicycles,</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">and set off for Chuo Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From here to Chuo Park is about 10 minutes by bicycle.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">On the way, we went through the avenue of cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Normally I avoid it on purpose, but without thinking I took this short cut.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The symptoms of my April sickness were lying low today, and I had forgotten even my usual habit.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―As we drew closer to Chuo Park, it grew noisy.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
